sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant RD as Redis Stream
  participant OR as Orchestrator
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant K8s as Kubernetes

  C->>GW: POST v2 session with Bearer JWT
  GW->>GW: JWT authZ and schema validation
  GW->>RD: XADD job submission envelope
  GW-->>C: 201 with job and submission ids

  OR->>RD: XREADGROUP orchestrator group
  RD-->>OR: stream message and payload
  OR->>DB: record received and events

  alt K8s submit enabled
    OR->>K8s: create suspended Job
    OR->>DB: mark k8s created or failure
  else Compose stream-only mode
    OR->>OR: skip Kubernetes calls
  end
